== a one-line enum past the width breaks one variant per line
faithful: true, fixpoint
1 |ValueShape* = StructValue|
2 |    | EnumValue|
3 |    | FnValue|
4 |    | PathValue|
5 |    | AliasValue|
6 |    | ExprValue|
== an anonymous union's bars break the same way
faithful: true, fixpoint
1 |handle = (r: Req) Res<str, Io|
2 |    | Parse|
3 |    | Net|
4 |    | AddressInUse|
5 |    | ConnectionReset|
6 |    | TimedOut> {|
7 |    r.run()|
8 |}|
== a represented enum keeps each discriminant with its variant
faithful: true, fixpoint
1 |FrameType*: u8 = Data = 0|
2 |    | Headers = 1|
3 |    | Priority = 2|
4 |    | Reset = 3|
5 |    | Settings = 4|
6 |    | Unknown(u8) = _|
